  "title": "World&#39;s Best Potato Salad",
  "description": "The best-ever potato salad is made with potatoes, eggs, and celery in a cooked dressing that&#39;s tangy, creamy, and the secret to this delicious side.",
  "authors": [
    "Kaye Lynn"
  ],
